menu "Matter C ESP ports"
config MATTER_C_ESP32_BLE
    bool "Matter commissioning over NimBLE/BTP"
    depends on BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED
    default n
    help
        Optional phase-owned peripheral transport. Uses the application's owner
        scheduler and shares runtime limits with UDP; does not enable UDP PASE.
config MATTER_C_ESP32_UDP_TRACE
    bool "Trace UDP send failures (no packet payloads)"
    default n
    help
        Development-only transport state/error counters on the console.
        Leave disabled in silent release images.
endmenu
